            "text": "It might just be all reference stuff. It'll be a loooong time before we can play with the real toys.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191725403"
            ]
          },
          "191725403": {
            "id": "191725403",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Alia",
            "text": "Guess all we can do is play Genius Invokation TCG in the meantime..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
